   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Clean gloss: median ~104, bright clean highlights (226,220,218 / p99 ~238), neutral-red shadows (36,28,28), red 43% with aqua/blue 31%, medium-low saturation (0.26), natural skin (hue 27). Best for: White / grey seamless studio portraits, beauty and fashion-style bridal portraits, high-key headshots, clean commercial frames.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
